# IMPORTANT: artifacts/ is INCLUDED in this repo so Streamlit Cloud can read
# the trained model + predictions + attention files. Total size is under 5 MB,
# well within GitHub's limits. If you ever need to ignore artifacts (e.g. to
# share the code without weights), uncomment the lines below:
#
# artifacts/data/
# artifacts/models/
# artifacts/predictions/
# artifacts/attention/
# artifacts/figures/
